# Everything in data/ stays local except the synthetic fixtures, DVC pointer
# files and this file. fights.csv, fighters.csv, raw video and anything else
# that could hold real fighter names can't be committed. The rules live here,
# not in the root .gitignore, because DVC stops seeing data/*.dvc when the root
# file ignores data/*.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/fixtures/
!/*.dvc
/derived
